# K-015 — repeated-window venue vs genuinely exhausted venue

A. StickyTail (venue ignores endTime and repeats its tail):
  [sticky] page 2: EMPTY page returned (code=None) -> this is the only completion signal the runner gets
  [sticky] venue retains 4 bars [1726434000000, 1726437600000, 1726441200000, 1726444800000]
  [sticky] bars served to the runner: [1726441200000, 1726444800000]
  [sticky] bars durably stored: 2
  [sticky] missing bars: [1726434000000, 1726437600000]
  [sticky] source reported an error/refusal at any point: no

B. HonestVenue (same 4 bars, endTime honoured):
  [honest] page 2: EMPTY page returned (code=None) -> this is the only completion signal the runner gets
  [honest] venue retains 4 bars [1726434000000, 1726437600000, 1726441200000, 1726444800000]
  [honest] bars served to the runner: [1726434000000, 1726437600000, 1726441200000, 1726444800000]
  [honest] bars durably stored: 4
  [honest] missing bars: []
  [honest] source reported an error/refusal at any point: no

